WEBVTT

00:00:04.197 --> 00:00:09.322
In order to save Candy,
Terry left the school in her place.

00:00:10.268 --> 00:00:12.875
When she realized what had happened,
Candy went after him.

00:00:13.628 --> 00:00:20.720
However, Terry's ship already left the port,
and Candy was unable to say farewell to him.

00:00:25.243 --> 00:00:28.260
And so... a week had passed.

00:00:29.815 --> 00:00:36.796
Departure shrouded by the morning mist.

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:54.377
Enter.

00:00:55.647 --> 00:00:57.591
I brought Candice.

00:01:02.106 --> 00:01:06.854
Candice White Adley,
your week of room confinement has passed.

00:01:06.889 --> 00:01:09.497
From now on, I'd like you to make
an effort at becoming a prominent lady!

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.492
-Do you understand?
-Yes.

00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:19.149
Becoming a prominent lady?

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.868
What is so great about being a lady?

00:01:25.303 --> 00:01:26.642
Candy!

00:01:26.677 --> 00:01:27.632
Candy!

00:01:29.782 --> 00:01:31.296
From today, you're free again?

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:33.237
Yes.

00:01:33.473 --> 00:01:34.498
Thank goodness!

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:37.219
You two must have been very worried, right?

00:01:37.413 --> 00:01:43.140
-Don't worry about us!
-But we're really sorry for what happened with Terry.

00:01:43.356 --> 00:01:44.218
Patty!

00:01:45.056 --> 00:01:49.567
Oh, no! I forgot that I'm not supposed
to bring up this topic in front of Candy...

00:01:50.128 --> 00:01:52.146
-Silly me...
-It's okay, Patty.

00:01:52.522 --> 00:01:55.993
But I really wanted to bid my farewell to him.

00:01:56.153 --> 00:01:58.439
We understand how you feel.

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:00.407
Now, let's go to the classroom!

00:02:13.218 --> 00:02:16.283
You have some nerve to show up here!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:21.342
That's right. If Terrius didn't stand in for you,
you would've been expelled now.

00:02:23.962 --> 00:02:28.457
Candy, how come that people who
bring calamity to others always survive?

00:02:29.588 --> 00:02:31.269
I bring calamity to others?

00:02:31.368 --> 00:02:33.067
Isn't it true?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:38.569
You caused Anthony's death, you also
drove Terry out of this school.

00:02:39.977 --> 00:02:41.761
Horrible! Eliza!

00:02:42.575 --> 00:02:43.861
Just who is horrible?

00:02:44.787 --> 00:02:49.044
You snatch away people,
leading them to their ruin!

00:02:49.575 --> 00:02:52.793
Eliza, you and Terry...

00:02:56.433 --> 00:02:58.159
Don't say such stupid things!

00:02:58.822 --> 00:03:01.489
I just can't forgive you!

00:03:01.924 --> 00:03:06.753
I see. So that's what it was.
Eliza had an eye on Terry.

00:03:07.685 --> 00:03:12.730
As for me, I can't forgive the fact that
she only spent a week in detention...

00:03:12.898 --> 00:03:16.222
...after Terry was expelled instead of her!

00:03:17.535 --> 00:03:18.408
That's right.

00:03:18.628 --> 00:03:22.623
How come the otherwise strict rules
have been so easily bent this time?

00:03:26.261 --> 00:03:28.614
We must have Candy expelled!

00:03:32.475 --> 00:03:34.480
You're saying horrible things, Eliza.

00:03:34.995 --> 00:03:37.667
That's right! She already bore her punishment!

00:03:38.311 --> 00:03:40.174
We can't agree with that.

00:03:40.497 --> 00:03:44.410
First of all, such a problem in school
concerns every one of us.

00:03:44.593 --> 00:03:48.298
That's right. Girls come to this school
in order to become ladies.

00:03:48.648 --> 00:03:52.252
But we've had nothing but trouble ever since
we got these two girls from Pony's home.

00:03:54.698 --> 00:03:56.030
Everyone, be quiet!

00:03:56.567 --> 00:03:58.223
Assume your seats, please.

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:11.281
Sister Chrisse, we'd like an explanation
of Candy's punishment.

00:04:11.971 --> 00:04:13.187
What?

00:04:14.423 --> 00:04:19.489
Candice isn't working at becoming a lady!
And yet, why is she still in this school?

00:04:21.285 --> 00:04:24.260
Are you asking why Candice isn't making any effort?

00:04:25.095 --> 00:04:28.078
Candice always causes so many trouble!

00:04:28.914 --> 00:04:32.911
While she worked as a dogsbody in our house,
she kept stealing from us!

00:04:36.687 --> 00:04:38.730
That's a lie!
She's making up!

00:04:38.926 --> 00:04:40.463
Wa... wait a second.

00:04:41.678 --> 00:04:45.542
Are you complaining upon the kind of punishment
sister Gray gave to Candy?

00:04:45.928 --> 00:04:46.886
Exactly!

00:04:48.571 --> 00:04:50.477
If you have any complaints, let's hear them.

00:04:53.596 --> 00:04:54.826
Sister Gray...

00:04:55.381 --> 00:04:57.611
Eliza Leagan. Speak up!

00:04:58.609 --> 00:05:01.739
Sister Gray, her punishment was ridiculous!

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.566
Pick your words, Eliza!

00:05:05.424 --> 00:05:10.298
I never thought that you would be the one
to bend rules! Is there something behind this?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:15.096
Eliza Leagan! You are henceforth
confined to your room for a week!

00:05:16.346 --> 00:05:17.546
I can't believe it!

00:05:18.419 --> 00:05:22.186
I'm returning you the letter
which you sent to Terrius!

00:05:34.773 --> 00:05:38.117
Eliza was confined to her room?
Feels great!

00:05:38.685 --> 00:05:42.808
I planned to use my lie detector to get a
confession out of her, but this is way better!

00:05:43.961 --> 00:05:45.673
What's the matter, Candy?

00:05:46.014 --> 00:05:48.983
I'd like to see Other Pony's hill.

00:05:50.077 --> 00:05:52.284
That's right, why don't we all go there?

00:05:52.803 --> 00:05:55.195
No, I meant alone.

00:05:56.342 --> 00:06:00.339
That's right, Candy wants some solitude to think.

00:06:01.921 --> 00:06:03.042
I'm sorry.

00:06:03.533 --> 00:06:09.412
Candy, feel free to go. Just make sure that you
come back with that usual smile of yours. Okay?

00:06:16.912 --> 00:06:18.765
She is preoccupied with Terry.

00:06:24.049 --> 00:06:24.800
Wait!

00:06:31.117 --> 00:06:33.543
Neil!
What's the meaning of this?

00:06:33.925 --> 00:06:38.457
Candy, it was your fault that Eliza
was confined to her room.

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.078
But it wasn't my fault!

00:06:41.481 --> 00:06:45.079
You haven't left this school,
so it has come down to this!

00:06:49.382 --> 00:06:50.585
What are you doing?

00:06:51.467 --> 00:06:54.154
-Go away!
-Stop this!

00:06:57.079 --> 00:07:00.134
Cry all you want to, Terry isn't here
to help you anymore!

00:07:01.361 --> 00:07:03.153
You should've gone away with Terry!

00:07:04.295 --> 00:07:05.142
Go away!

00:07:05.245 --> 00:07:06.222
Leave!

00:07:06.383 --> 00:07:07.108
Leave!

00:07:09.871 --> 00:07:13.570
We'll get it out on you
for every single time Terry hurt us!

00:07:13.765 --> 00:07:14.883
Remember this well!

00:07:16.342 --> 00:07:16.922
Let's go.

00:07:23.894 --> 00:07:27.083
Terry, why didn't you take me with yourself?

00:07:27.703 --> 00:07:29.718
I... I want to leave, too!

00:07:37.913 --> 00:07:38.944
Kurin!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.614
Thank you, Kurin.
I'm fine now.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.567
You want me to climb it?

00:07:48.994 --> 00:07:49.831
Okay.

00:07:55.318 --> 00:07:57.599
So many sweets!

00:07:58.331 --> 00:07:59.906
Terry let you have them?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.500
Terry...

00:08:02.859 --> 00:08:05.260
I don't want to live in a place
where you aren't around.

00:08:05.805 --> 00:08:11.352
But if I were to leave this place...
I would've trampled over everything Terry did for me.

00:08:12.021 --> 00:08:14.289
Terry, I want to do my best!

00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:17.501
I'm not going to give in to
Eliza's and Neil's ploys.

00:08:22.274 --> 00:08:24.914
Confining me to my room for a week...

00:08:25.283 --> 00:08:28.102
Very well. I'm sure I'll come up with
something fun in the meantime.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.122
I'll have Candy expelled for sure!

00:08:43.058 --> 00:08:45.578
Welcome, Duke Grandchester.

00:08:46.171 --> 00:08:49.251
Sister Gray.
I'm here to have a word with you.

00:08:50.197 --> 00:08:51.303
Please, this way.

00:08:56.723 --> 00:08:57.944
How can I help you?

00:09:00.497 --> 00:09:02.421
Please take a look at this.

00:09:04.071 --> 00:09:10.195
Terrius wrote about how he left school
in place of that girl, Candy.

00:09:10.755 --> 00:09:11.955
Terrius wrote...

00:09:12.705 --> 00:09:14.900
Is this true, sister Gray?

00:09:15.273 --> 00:09:18.064
I thought you already knew about this.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.098
So that's how it was.

00:09:21.869 --> 00:09:26.345
I heard him mentioning this, but I didn't think
that he was serious about it.

00:09:27.134 --> 00:09:30.347
Sister Gray. Why didn't you inform me any sooner?

00:09:30.985 --> 00:09:37.698
It's... I thought that Grandchester's name could be
tarnished if we made too much noise about it.

00:09:38.299 --> 00:09:39.831
And where did my son go?

00:09:40.245 --> 00:09:42.791
Well... most likely to America.

00:09:43.255 --> 00:09:44.482
America?

00:09:45.326 --> 00:09:47.785
That means - to Eleanor's.

00:09:49.295 --> 00:09:51.818
Sister Gray, I want you to bring back my son.

00:09:51.988 --> 00:09:52.819
What?

00:09:53.003 --> 00:09:57.283
If you are unable to do that, I will have to
discontinue my donations to this school.

00:09:57.654 --> 00:10:00.214
But, Duke Grandchester...!

00:10:00.396 --> 00:10:01.716
Am I not correct?

00:10:02.017 --> 00:10:06.111
Why would I support a school that
my son doesn't attend?

00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:07.767
I... I understand.

00:10:08.198 --> 00:10:10.922
I'll do my best to bring him back.

00:10:11.147 --> 00:10:12.588
Do you have any traces?

00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:18.204
Candice might know more
about where Terrius is heading.

00:10:18.375 --> 00:10:23.630
In that case, sister Gray,
why don't you call over this Candice.

00:10:23.896 --> 00:10:26.440
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Hay guys we gots a new CM break panel!
And it's ugly, to boot!

00:10:39.023 --> 00:10:40.861
You are Candice?

00:10:41.268 --> 00:10:42.096
Yes.

00:10:42.519 --> 00:10:46.072
You know where is Terrius?

00:10:46.325 --> 00:10:47.193
No.

00:10:47.582 --> 00:10:53.297
Candice. Do you know whether Terrius made
this decision on his own accord?

00:10:53.332 --> 00:10:59.906
Terry... no, Terrius only wrote that he's going
to America, but he didn't mention any details.

00:11:01.107 --> 00:11:03.035
Is that true?

00:11:03.201 --> 00:11:04.145
It's true!

00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:07.978
I wish he told me where he was going.

00:11:12.195 --> 00:11:15.921
You were brought up in Pony's home, am I correct?

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:17.252
Yes.

00:11:18.045 --> 00:11:21.120
You tended horses, too, am I correct?

00:11:21.351 --> 00:11:24.378
You must have heard this from Eliza.

00:11:25.247 --> 00:11:26.355
Eliza?

00:11:27.202 --> 00:11:29.773
I only heard the truth.

00:11:31.261 --> 00:11:33.228
You were correct about these things.

00:11:33.977 --> 00:11:36.519
And then you were adopted by the Adleys.

00:11:36.677 --> 00:11:39.430
Otherwise you wouldn't have had the chance
to study in this school.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.688
Maybe Terrius came to his senses...

00:11:44.792 --> 00:11:46.747
...when he decided to leave this school.

00:11:49.282 --> 00:11:54.547
Sister Gray. When you bring him back,
I will have him transferred to a different school.

00:11:54.717 --> 00:11:57.657
And what will happen with your donations?

00:11:57.715 --> 00:11:59.452
We need not talk about that.

00:12:00.076 --> 00:12:05.327
Duke Grandchester... if you stop your donations now,
the school can not survive!

00:12:05.934 --> 00:12:08.441
Please, if I may ask for just a little...

00:12:08.647 --> 00:12:10.545
Excuse me, sister Gray.

00:12:17.132 --> 00:12:18.818
Duke Grandchester...!

00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:23.305
Please wait!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:23.883
Candice!

00:12:31.372 --> 00:12:33.584
Please wait! I'd like to speak with you!

00:12:36.277 --> 00:12:37.254
Go.

00:12:41.533 --> 00:12:42.670
Wait!

00:13:00.487 --> 00:13:02.070
Duke Grandchester!

00:13:04.347 --> 00:13:06.593
Please! I need to speak to you!

00:13:10.124 --> 00:13:11.409
Stop the carriage!

00:13:28.809 --> 00:13:31.673
Nobody will see us here.
You can speak now.

00:13:31.867 --> 00:13:35.870
Why didn't you try to better understand Terrius?

00:13:36.037 --> 00:13:39.677
You're saying that you understand him
better than his own father?

00:13:39.865 --> 00:13:40.614
Yes.

00:13:40.919 --> 00:13:42.901
You're pretty fresh.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.620
You have no parents, so how can you tell?

00:13:45.836 --> 00:13:46.967
Exactly because of that.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:52.420
Because I have no parents... I know it well.
Terrius's loneliness...

00:13:52.835 --> 00:13:55.674
Terrius wants the love of his true father!

00:13:55.908 --> 00:13:58.527
It's the love of his mother that he wants.

00:13:59.625 --> 00:14:01.351
He already has that.

00:14:01.625 --> 00:14:02.495
What?

00:14:02.618 --> 00:14:04.179
Terrius has Eleanor's...

00:14:05.731 --> 00:14:07.801
You didn't know that, too?

00:14:08.122 --> 00:14:11.952
No, you didn't want to know anything about Terrius.

00:14:12.118 --> 00:14:15.005
He never mentioned that he wanted to see Eleanor...

00:14:16.089 --> 00:14:19.990
He was forcibly separated from his mother...
No wonder he started defying you.

00:14:20.143 --> 00:14:24.225
But you didn't even try to understand his feelings.

00:14:26.743 --> 00:14:31.376
Terrius is really a gentle, considerate,
wonderful person!

00:14:32.787 --> 00:14:35.365
You like Terrius?

00:14:36.464 --> 00:14:37.232
Yes.

00:14:43.322 --> 00:14:46.957
Candy. I decided to quit school
and go to America.

00:14:47.129 --> 00:14:47.902
There is something I'd like to do.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.781
Wherever I might end up, I'll be praying
for your happiness. Terrius.

00:14:51.688 --> 00:14:54.704
What is he planning to do in America?

00:14:54.887 --> 00:14:56.231
I don't know either.

00:14:56.688 --> 00:14:59.618
But I'm sure that he's trying
to find his own path in life.

00:15:00.844 --> 00:15:06.481
Therefore... please don't call Terrius back
and take away his freedom. Please.

00:15:08.843 --> 00:15:10.628
This is all I had to say.

00:15:11.014 --> 00:15:15.301
I don't think we'll be seeing each other again.
Farewell, Duke Grandchester.

00:15:18.308 --> 00:15:19.906
Hold on, Candy.

00:15:22.309 --> 00:15:23.951
I'll take you back to school.

00:15:24.361 --> 00:15:26.042
No, I'll go back on foot.

00:15:26.185 --> 00:15:28.933
I have some things to do at the school, as well.

00:15:29.139 --> 00:15:30.106
Things to do?

00:15:30.701 --> 00:15:33.042
To talk about restoring my donations to the school.

00:15:35.711 --> 00:15:40.187
Someday, that school will have to take
care of Terry's younger brother and sister.

00:15:41.087 --> 00:15:42.744
Duke Grandchester!

00:15:46.589 --> 00:15:48.162
Well, hop in.

00:15:48.914 --> 00:15:49.831
Yes.

00:16:02.982 --> 00:16:06.546
Candy. Owing to you, we are saved.

00:16:06.886 --> 00:16:10.381
No, it was because Duke Grandchester was a good man.

00:16:10.499 --> 00:16:13.241
Anyway, the school is saved.

00:16:17.378 --> 00:16:19.232
Excuse me, sister Gray.

00:16:19.647 --> 00:16:22.088
A telegram came from Louise's house.

00:16:22.156 --> 00:16:23.388
Louise's house?

00:16:29.516 --> 00:16:31.043
Call Louise!

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:31.935
Yes.

00:16:32.722 --> 00:16:36.411
Well then, you may return to your class.

00:16:37.133 --> 00:16:37.864
Yes.

00:16:47.454 --> 00:16:48.704
What's going on?

00:16:50.185 --> 00:16:56.377
Since you flunked your classes, your father
is having you removed from this school.

00:16:57.977 --> 00:16:59.529
My father?

00:16:59.705 --> 00:17:03.996
You will stay here until they send
the carriage to pick you up.

00:17:04.122 --> 00:17:06.363
My father is...

00:17:12.958 --> 00:17:15.081
What happened, Louise?

00:17:20.553 --> 00:17:22.232
What's the matter?

00:17:22.636 --> 00:17:25.816
I... I can't become a lady anymore!

00:17:28.312 --> 00:17:31.161
They are making me quit this school!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.066
Louise is...?

00:17:54.342 --> 00:17:58.103
I... I can't become a lady anymore!

00:17:59.181 --> 00:18:00.879
You're wrong, Louise.

00:18:00.998 --> 00:18:05.095
You don't become a lady
simply by being in this school.

00:18:07.114 --> 00:18:10.031
It's not true that one can't be a lady
unless she is wealthy.

00:18:10.409 --> 00:18:12.998
Otherwise... she is a sham lady!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:24.357
Up until now, I've completely relied
on benevolence of the Adley family.

00:18:24.844 --> 00:18:27.497
Just what were trying to turn me into
by sending me here?

00:18:29.473 --> 00:18:33.175
I don't want to turn into a sham lady
like Louise and Eliza.

00:18:34.112 --> 00:18:36.075
Such a thing has no sense.

00:18:38.204 --> 00:18:41.101
Terry went to America to build his own path.

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:46.466
And mr. Albert is taking pride
in his hard work in Africa.

00:18:48.202 --> 00:18:52.700
Just like Terry renounced his Grandchester name,
I will renounce my Adley name.

00:18:53.503 --> 00:18:55.696
I will tread my own path in life!

00:18:56.319 --> 00:18:59.989
I'm sure that Terry and mr. Albert
would've understood.

00:19:02.061 --> 00:19:04.297
I feel as if I got something heavy off my chest!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:12.062
I somehow feel sorry for Eliza who is going
to stay here and work hard to become a lady!

00:19:18.829 --> 00:19:20.470
What is it, this late?

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.583
Sister Gray, please amend Eliza's punishment.

00:19:26.162 --> 00:19:27.245
Please.

00:19:27.702 --> 00:19:28.788
Candy.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:34.939
Now that her best friend Louise is gone,
I'm sure that Eliza will be lonely.

00:19:35.827 --> 00:19:37.966
I don't want to cause her any more...

00:19:38.127 --> 00:19:39.616
I understand, Candice.

00:19:40.319 --> 00:19:44.881
After all, it was you who saved this school.
I'll see to it.

00:19:44.916 --> 00:19:47.344
Thank you so much, sister Gray!

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:01.480
Kurin!

00:20:02.577 --> 00:20:03.586
Kurin!

00:20:11.493 --> 00:20:13.958
Kurin, let's get out of here.

00:20:23.856 --> 00:20:25.038
Alright!

00:20:34.149 --> 00:20:35.337
Come, Kurin!

00:20:45.849 --> 00:20:50.926
Farewell; Stear, Archie, Annie, Patty...

00:20:51.438 --> 00:20:53.391
Farewell, St. Paul academy!

00:20:54.214 --> 00:20:55.690
Let's go, Kurin!

00:21:05.746 --> 00:21:11.056
The morning mist
completely engulfed the St. Paul academy.

00:21:11.873 --> 00:21:18.500
Candy flew to her freedom like a
little bird, released from a cage.

00:21:18.505 --> 00:21:20.197
To be continued.
